{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Tresor 是一款私密相片影片保險庫，適合想將個人媒體從主相簿分開、加強私隱保護的 iPhone 用戶。它提供私人金庫、私人相簿、個別相簿 PIN 鎖定、緊急 PIN、失敗存取記錄、快速退出及 Wi-Fi 傳輸等功能。原價 US $29.99 的終生版內購現正限時免費，可於應用內以 $0 領取。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-184.webp\">\n<h2>私密相片影片保護工具</h2>\n<p>Tresor 可將 iPhone 相片與影片匯入私人金庫，建立並重新命名私人相簿。用戶能為個別相簿增設獨立 PIN，並以緊急 PIN 開啟假檢視。啟用權限後，失敗存取會被記錄，甚至拍下闖入者自拍。快速退出可即時離開私密內容，亦支援在同一 Wi-Fi 網絡下與電腦互傳媒體。最近刪除項目可還原，PIN 恢復問題由用戶自行保管。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-205-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-206-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-207-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-208-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-209-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-210-scaled.jpg\">\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Private Safe Pic Vault: Tresor 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Private Safe Pic Vault: Tresor</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T12:39:54.052205+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":515,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T12:35:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T14:38:26.801860+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T12:37:38.219873+00:00","content_hash":"60742b01508db33c8a7dcdae3acd42da8c17547938b2421adbdcf68d37fb40ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}